    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my kitchen sink is acting up. the water is just sitting there, all dark and murky, and it smells really bad. it's like there's something solid stuck deep down in the pipes that i can't see. what's the best way to figure out what's actually down there without making a huge mess?",
